    "type": "question",
    "label": "52",
    "prompt": "For each of the following, determine if the sets are disjoint or not disjoint.\n$$\\begin{aligned}A&=\\{\\text{even \\#’s}\\}\\\\B&=\\{\\text{prime \\#’s}\\}\\end{aligned}$$",
    "layout": "list",
